    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the translating sleeve aft seal and heat shield installation, showing the bonded strip and the high temperature carrier seals as alternates with the shim selection.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the aft seal, the heat shield, the retaining fasteners and the shim selection on a thrust reverser translating sleeve.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward at the sleeve mounted in the shop stand. The alternates at item 10 are the bonded strip seal and the high temperature seal on its metal carrier; the two are not interchangeable because the land profile differs. The heat shield at item 20 is 80 mm longer on the high temperature standard. The shims at item 40 are supplied as a selection covering the whole measured range and only the required thicknesses are consumed at build."
    },
